BC Partners LLP is incorporated in England and Wales and registered at Companies House (no. OC404426). The registered office of BC Partners LLP is at 40 Portman Square, London W1H 6DA. BC Partners LLP’s VAT registration number is GB 240 7699 88.

You can contact BC Partners LLP by email at london@bcpartners.com or by post at our registered office address above.

BC Partners LLP acts as adviser to:

CIE Management IX Limited (“CIE IX”);

BCEC Management X Limited (“BCECX”);

BC Partners Management XI Limited (“BCPMXI”);

BC Partners Management XII Limited (“BCPMXII”); and

BC Partners Management S.à r.l (“BCPM”). [...] This website and the information and materials contained within it (this “Site”) are communicated and issued by BC Partners LLP. This Site uses the term “Partner” to denote certain senior professionals, officers and employees of BC Partners. Notwithstanding the use of this term, none of BC Partners’ officers or employees necessarily carries on business as a partnership or in partnership with each other. Nothing on this Site should be construed as indicating otherwise.

By accessing this Site you agree to be bound by the terms of this Legal Notice. If you do not accept these terms, please do not continue to access this Site. [...] BC Partners PE L.P. is a United States Registered Investment Adviser and provides sub-advisory services in respect of BC Partners private equity strategies.

On this website, references to “BC Partners” are to one or more (as the context requires) of BC Partners LLP; BC Partners Advisors L.P.; BC Partners PE L.P.; CIE IX; BCECX; BCPMXI; BCPMXII and certain other affiliated companies (including BC Partners Advisors S.à r.l. and BC Partner Beteiligungsberatung GmbH).
